## Phase 0 — Pre-flight (do this ONCE before anything else)

- [ ] **VPN is OFF** and stays off for the entire setup
- [ ] Set a **static IP** on Laptop B so it never changes again:
  - Settings → Network & Internet → Wi-Fi → Properties → IP Settings → Edit → Manual
  - IP: `192.168.1.10` / Subnet: `255.255.255.0` / Gateway: `192.168.1.1` / DNS: `8.8.8.8`
- [ ] Confirm it took effect:
  ```powershell
  ipconfig | findstr "IPv4"
  ```
  Should show `192.168.1.9`

