## Phase 8 — Dashboard check

```
https://localhost
```

- [ ] SSL warning → Advanced → Proceed
- [ ] Login with `admin` / `SecretPassword` (or whatever is in `docker-compose.yml`)
- [ ] Dashboard loads without "No API available to connect"
- [ ] No "Saved object for index pattern not found" errors

